  CVE-2026-34514|2026-04-01T21:16:59.417|2026-04-03T16:10:52.680|2.7|LOW|CWE-113|N/A|false|AIOHTTP is an asynchronous HTTP client/server framework for asyncio and Python. Prior to version 3.13.4, an attacker who controls the content_type parameter in aiohttp could use this to inject extra headers or similar exploits. This issue has been patched in version 3.13.4.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-34514|0.00045|0.13762|1.8913
