  CVE-2026-20093|2026-04-01T17:28:29.027|2026-04-03T16:11:11.357|9.8|CRITICAL|CWE-20|N/A|false|"A vulnerability in the change password functionality of Cisco Integrated Management Controller (IMC) could allow an unauthenticated, remote attacker to bypass authentication and gain access to the system as&nbsp;Admin.

